<figure class="article-figure npu-stack-figure">
  <div class="npu-stack" role="img" aria-labelledby="npu-stack-title" aria-describedby="npu-stack-description">
    <p id="npu-stack-title" class="eyebrow">From ONNX model to XDNA2</p>
    <p id="npu-stack-description" class="visually-hidden">
      The ONNX model uses ONNX Runtime 1.27.0 and its Vitis AI execution provider from Ryzen AI Software 1.8.
      The NPU path connects through XRT 2.26.0 and the XDNA userspace plugin 2.26.0 to the existing CachyOS
      amdxdna kernel driver and the AMD XDNA2 NPU. ONNX Runtime also executes CPU-assigned operators on the CPU.
    </p>
