        <span class="npu-stack-label">Hardware</span>
        <div class="npu-stack-node">
          <strong>AMD XDNA2 NPU</strong>
          <span>Ryzen AI 9 HX 470</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    The tested NPU path, with userspace components installed above the existing kernel driver.
    ONNX Runtime also executes the operators assigned to the CPU.
